// Scroll the MAIN frame before the capture, synchronously at parse time so the position is settled
// long before any CDP read. `scroll_page` covers the at-rest case; the recorded corpus contains no
// page whose main document is scrolled, which leaves the page-absolute-geometry invariant
// (DOMSnapshot bounds are document coordinates and do NOT move with the scroll offset — only the
// viewport band moves) with no fixture behind it. Deterministic: one absolute scroll, no timers.
window.scrollTo(0, 2000);

